cceed, regardless of circumstances. \r\n\r\nThe group has presented the Horatio Alger Award to a new class of about 10 to 12 people annually. Since 1984, the organization has given college scholarships to high school students \u201cwho fit the Horatio Alger profile.\u201d Upward of $245 million has gone to more than 35,000 students. \r\n\r\n", "website": "https://horatioalger.org", "parent_id": null, "primary_ext": "Org", "updated_at": "2024-05-07T03:25:08Z", "start_date": "1946-00-00", "end_date": null, "connected_relationship_ids": "230415", "connected_category_id": 1, "aliases": ["Horatio Alger Association", "Horatio Alger Association of Distinguished Americans", "Horation Alger Association"], "types": ["Organization", "Membership Organization", "Philanthropy", "Other Not-for-Profit"], "extensions": {"Org": {"name": "Horatio Alger Association", "name_nick": null, "employees": null, "revenue": null, "fedspending_id": null, "lda_registrant_id": null}}, "tags": []}, "links": {"self": "https://littlesis.org/entities/44720-Horatio_Alger_Association"}}, {"type": "entities", "id": 39305, "attributes": {"id": 39305, "name": "Mayo Clinic", "blurb": "Mayo Clinic is the first and largest integrated, not-for-profit group practice in the world.", "summary": null, "website": null, "parent_id": null, "primary_ext": "Org", "updated_at": "2025-07-11T19:35:22Z", "start_date": null, "end_date": null, "connected_relationship_ids": "196541", "connected_category_id": 1, "aliases": ["Mayo Clinic"], "types": ["Organization", "Philanthropy"], "extensions": {"Org": {"name": "Mayo Clinic", "name_nick": null, "employees": null, "revenue": null, "fedspending_id": null, "lda_registrant_id": null}}, "tags": []}, "links": {"self": "https://littlesis.org/entities/39305-Mayo_Clinic"}}, {"type": "entities", "id": 127385, "attributes": {"id": 127385, "name": "The Aerospace Corporation", "blurb": "Provides scientific services for the USAF community", "summary": null, "website": "https://aerospace.or